00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:41.720
or syntax tree for the grammar. We also call it as a derivation tree. If you go from sentence to

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:50.280
the sentence symbol to the sentence, it is a derivation. If you go from the sentence to the

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:56.960
