00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:20.700
phrase one and verb phrase. The sentence symbol goes to noun phrase one and verb phrase. Similarly,

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:36.120
for each one of that, we will write the rules. Then noun phrase one goes to article and noun

00:06:36.120 --> 00:07:07.830
one. Article goes to the noun one goes to man and verb phrase goes to verb and noun phrase two.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:31.000
Verb goes to eight. Noun phrase two goes to article and noun two. Again, article goes to these already

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:55.020
there. Noun two goes to. So, using these rules, these are called rules or productions. Rules or

00:07:55.020 --> 00:08:11.820
productions are sometimes called production rules. And using these rules, you can derive this

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:18.740
sentence. The man ate the fruit from S. I am not distinguishing between this T and this T.

