00:31:39.020 --> 00:31:55.810
Phrase structure, this is the most general type of a grammar. There the rules are of

00:31:55.810 --> 00:32:08.890
the form u goes to v, where u belongs to v star n plus v star n plus v star n plus

00:32:08.910 --> 00:32:17.760
v star. It is a string of non terminals and terminals, but it should have at least one

00:32:17.760 --> 00:32:24.460
